- Green phase: CI=true npm test -> 2 files, 22 tests passed (191ms).
- npm run build -> "Compiled successfully in 7.4s", no type errors.

Cases covered: AU default bounds; an earlier year; 29 Feb in a leap year
and 28 Feb outside one; calendar-year FY; inclusive-bound adjacency;
30 June / 1 July rollover boundaries; custom 1 April FY start; label
padding (2000-01); and selectable-year list excluding the in-progress year.

NOTES
No call sites use this yet - wiring into the tax report is the fourth
task of this phase. Assertions use Date.UTC so they are timezone
independent, and exact ISO strings would catch drift if reintroduced.
